{
  "$comment": [
    "后端（宿主壳）类型的唯一执法配置。旗组合 = docs/plan/后端TS迁移/README.md §6 S0 满载档。",
    "★ 两条与 §6 首选不同的地方（B0-a 实测，见该目录 日志.md）：",
    "  1. `verbatimModuleSyntax` **必须关**：本目录最近的 package.json 是 \"type\":\"commonjs\" ⇒ 文件按 CJS 处理，",
    "     开着它时 ESM 语法被拒（TS1295/TS1287）。README §6 S0-6 预置的替代阶梯即此 ⇒ 「@shared 只许类型导入」",
    "     由 eslint 的 no-restricted-imports（allowTypeImports）承担，仍是机器检查，只是载体换了。",
    "  2. `moduleResolution` **不用 node10**：TS 6 已弃用（TS5107），靠 ignoreDeprecations 才跑得动 ⇒ 定稿 node16。",
    "`allowJs` = 混合期的过桥（未转 .js 原样过一遍，不进类型检查）；`checkJs` 的测量归 census 脚本。"
  ],
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2023",
    "lib": ["ES2023", "DOM"],
    "module": "node16",
    "moduleResolution": "node16",
    "types": ["node"],

    "strict": true,
    "useUnknownInCatchVariables": true,
    "strictBuiltinIteratorReturn": true,
    "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": true,
    "exactOptionalPropertyTypes": true,
    "noImplicitOverride": true,
    "noImplicitReturns": true,
    "noPropertyAccessFromIndexSignature": true,
    "noFallthroughCasesInSwitch": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "noUnusedParameters": true,
    "allowUnreachableCode": false,
    "allowUnusedLabels": false,
    "noUncheckedSideEffectImports": true,
    "moduleDetection": "force",
    "noErrorTruncation": true,

    "verbatimModuleSyntax": false,
    "erasableSyntaxOnly": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true,

    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": false,
    "noEmitOnError": true,
    "sourceMap": true,
    "incremental": true,

    "rootDir": ".",
    "outDir": "dist",
    "paths": { "@shared/*": ["../build/shared-types/*"] }
  },
  "include": ["**/*"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules", "dist", "dola-duration-main.js"]
}
